sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: An idToken with the MastersPass as GroupId is configured
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted for all EVSE

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.groupIdToken.idToken must be <Configured masterPassGroupId>

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = MasterPass, idToken.idToken = <Configured masterpass_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured masterpass_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.groupIdToken.idToken must be <Configured masterPassGroupId>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
